; Vertically Integrated Liquid, VIL (kg/m^2) — authored for this project
; over the conventional 0..80 kg/m^2 NWS-style display range
; (compute::derived's VIL_MAX_KG_M2, ADR-0020). Not sourced from a specific
; published GRLevelX palette — see ADR-0021's verification note. Follows
; the same blue-to-magenta progression as reflectivity, since VIL is
; derived from it and operators read the two together.
